[38;2;124;124;124m**Direct proof sketch:**[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mLet $G$ be a compact abelian group (metrizability not needed). We want to show [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mcharacters separate points.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mStep 1: Show that $G$ is an inverse limit of compact abelian Lie groups.[0m

